{
  "label": "rindorm50special",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label rindorm50special:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine1.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually, Sir...On second thought, I don’t think this is a good idea anymore.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It sounded reasonable when we were in my room, but now that I’m in front of her door, I’m beginning to think that this isn’t exactly “staying away.”",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Isn’t that the entire reason we came down here? Because staying away isn’t helping either of you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know...If what Haruka says is true, Rin has been doing pretty okay without me.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And it’s not like I’m doing anything self-destructive either. I’m just more...tired. Both physically and mentally.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, what happens in a game if you give up or fail a quest?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You normally just get to try again later.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? You’ll never-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, really? That’s not a harsh consequence at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine2.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know! Which is one of the many reasons I keep telling you that games are better than real life!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I fail this mission now, I might not be able to try again!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, on the other hand, if you succeed...you get your best friend and unrequited love back.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine3.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rejoice! Another chance to be unloved!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just kidding. The first part sounds rather nice.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine1.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just don’t think it’s going to go the way you imagine, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For all we know, Rin could be in there unlocking event CGs with her new girlfriend right now.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or, alternatively, she could be in there sleeping.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How is that any better?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you rather her be fingering Otoha?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine4.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d rather her be fingering me.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s the Molly I know and...don’t love.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you, Sir. Thank you for not loving me.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t take it personally. I don’t really love anyone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This disclaimer should have been printed on the back of the cartridge before I plugged it into my system.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s no way they’re still using cartridges for games in this day and age.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re not, Sir. I intentionally dated my analogy so you wouldn’t get confused by it.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Appreciated. Now, are we doing this or not?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine5.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...Rin?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry to bother you even though you told me to stay away...but I was wondering if...I could come in for a minute or two.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A moment of silence goes by as Molly and I wait out in the hall.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The rest of the girls are holed up inside of their rooms right now and are likely trying to go to sleep given the fact it’s-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Holy shit. Is it really midnight already?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Today went by way too quickly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine1.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think she’s in there, Sir. And...if she is, she’s probably sleeping.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not go in and check? That’s what I always do when I’m in doubt.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why aren’t you understanding that me being intrusive is exactly what got me into this mess? I’m not going to fix that by...being intrusive in a slightly different way.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t know that, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do know that, though.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, if you want to give up now, we can always-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine6.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excellent idea, Sir. Let’s give up now and try again later.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, it’s an anticlimactic end to the night. But if that’s really what you think is-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine7.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Listen.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I heard something.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heard what? It’s the middle of the night.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine8.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Which is also the perfect time to unlock event CGs.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No way. She’s probably just talking in her sleep.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m scared, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re that scared, just leave. That’s what we were about to do anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but...that was before we confirmed movement.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The event is already in progress. We can’t back out anymore.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that really how it works?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m going in.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How did we switch sides on this matter so quickly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m coming-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": AHH!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene contentwarning",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/contentwarning.png",
      "alt": "contentwarning"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene everythingg7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/everythingg7.png",
      "alt": "everythingg7"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene treefall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/treefall1.png",
      "alt": "treefall1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amibreak1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/amibreak1.png",
      "alt": "amibreak1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine9.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you doing?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heeeeeeeeeeey.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s up, you guys?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin, what have you done?! I thought you stopped!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You told me you stopped!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine10.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heheh...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whoooooops...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Looks like I’m a liar...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Careful, Molly. Your hands are gonna get all messy.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...I don’t...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When did you do this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine11.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aaaaaay, Sensei’s here too.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just look. When do you think I did it, dude? Why’s that even matter?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...so much blood...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Felt like it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine12.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you okay? Well, I mean...obviously you’re not okay. But...are you feeling lightheaded? Are you dizzy?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, Molly, Molly.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, Molly, Molly, Molly, Molly.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? What is it?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You fucked up, girl.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine13.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This...isn’t because-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, no. No no no. This isn’t your fault. It’s nobody’s.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just happens sometimes.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. Hard to think when my body feels like it’s being packed into a ziplock bag.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then...how did I mess up?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cause you chose me, idiot.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this really what you want?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinisstillfine14.webp",
      "alt": "rinisstillfine14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, you didn't have to say it like-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is that supposed to mean?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just that you can do better. That’s all.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
