      "alt": "rinisstillfine32"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": True. And it must really suck since I didn’t even flash you to take your mind off of it all tonight.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That wasn’t something I enjoyed, for the record. It was incredibly depressing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, well...if you’re gonna keep hanging around me while I’m like this, chances are you might get a little depressed every now and then.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve always got the option to walk away, you know.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, too.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I were her, I probably would have ran off the moment I said she fucked up.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly’s actually been surprisingly mature about this whole situation. I’ve been with her all night.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bet that makes me look like a real immature son of a bitch then, huh?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m going to do my best to abstain from judging you right now, thanks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re cute when you pretend to care.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t let Otoha hear that or there might be another breakdown like this in store for the near future.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinisstillfine33",
