      "alt": "rinisstillfine33"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck fuck fuck!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What am I gonna tell Otoha?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doesn’t she already know you have a history of...this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but if she finds out that I started doing it again right after we started dating, how do you think that’s going to make her feel?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I imagine pretty shitty.",
