      "alt": "rinisstillfine34"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. No no no no no no no no no. I have to hide it. She can’t know.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If she knows then she’ll start worrying. If she worries too much, she’ll get exhausted. If she’s exhausted, she won’t want me anymore.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have to be wanted. I need her to want me. I can’t lose her now, Sensei. I can’t. I can’t. I can’t. I can’t.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Calm down.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re good at hiding this sort of thing, aren’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right. Yeah. I’m good at hiding this. She’s not going to find out.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, it would probably be best if you just dropped this habit altogether as well but, based on what you said earlier, I can’t foresee that happening any time soon.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll stop. I’ll stop for Otoha. Otoha doesn’t want me to do this. I’ll get better. I’ll be better.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I won’t cut myself anymore. I’ll be happier. I’ll be the happiest girl in the world.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have everything I want. Why on earth would I be sad?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
